      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That is a very logical way to view life, but it misses the point that the \"dues\" are paid for something far more valuable than mere survival. The feeling of being trapped is actually a sign that you are deeply aware of the weight you carry, which is the first step toward choosing a different path. Instead of treating existence as an involuntary contract, try to see it as a series of small, intentional choices you make every single day. You have the power to decide whether to keep paying the subscription or to cancel it entirely and start a new one.",
